{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x19---lisas-wedding",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x19 - Lisa's Wedding",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x19 - Lisa's Wedding.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:06:08.389Z",
  "lineCount": 298,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Lisa's Wedding",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2480,
      "endMs": 3957
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Zounds! I did thee mightily smitely.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37917,
      "endMs": 41037
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "\"Zounds\" is a Renaissance English word, short for \"God's wounds\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43219,
      "endMs": 46373
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "...but \"smitely,\" that's pure Flanders.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46574,
      "endMs": 48755
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Please call a doctor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49796,
      "endMs": 51172
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "These Renaissance fairs are so boring. Oh, really? Did you see the loom?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 52010,
      "endMs": 57984
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I took loom in high school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58722,
      "endMs": 60433
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Yon meat 'tis sweet as summer's wafting breeze.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72883,
      "endMs": 75433
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Can I have some? Mine ears are open to the pleas...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75635,
      "endMs": 78084
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "...of those who speak ye old English.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78319,
      "endMs": 80131
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Sweet maiden of the spit, grant now my boon, that I might sup...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 80299,
      "endMs": 83688
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "...upon suckling pig this noon. - Whatever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 83890,
      "endMs": 86541
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "I've eaten eight different meats. I'm a true Renaissance man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87782,
      "endMs": 90635
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I'll go to the first-aid tent and tell them to plug in ye old stomach pump.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92480,
      "endMs": 96675
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Alight your gaze on yonder fabled beasts of yore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 100198,
      "endMs": 102581
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Behold the rarest of the rare...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 107111,
      "endMs": 108990
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "...the mythological two-headed hound, born with only one head.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109158,
      "endMs": 113487
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "And here, out of the mists of history, the legendary esquilax: A horse with the head of a rabbit and the body of a rabbit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113688,
      "endMs": 123017
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "It's galloping away.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124661,
      "endMs": 125870
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Here, bunny-bunny. Here, bunny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126037,
      "endMs": 127816
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Here, \"esquilax.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127950,
      "endMs": 129192
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "I've been waiting for you, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141541,
      "endMs": 143856
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "How did you know my name? Your nametag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144292,
      "endMs": 146809
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Would you like to know your future?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 149125,
      "endMs": 151172
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Sorry, I don't believe in fortunetelling. I should go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151608,
      "endMs": 154359
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "What's your hurry? Bart, Maggie and Marge are at the joust.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154561,
      "endMs": 157312
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "And Homer is heckling the puppet show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157480,
      "endMs": 159796
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Wow, you can see into the present.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159997,
      "endMs": 162917
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Now we'll see what the future holds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163151,
      "endMs": 166037
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "The death card? No, that's good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168417,
      "endMs": 170430
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "It means transition, change.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170598,
      "endMs": 173584
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "That's cute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174960,
      "endMs": 176235
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "The happy squirrel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176403,
      "endMs": 177611
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "That's bad? Possibly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177812,
      "endMs": 179188
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "The cards are vague and mysterious.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179356,
      "endMs": 181705
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "They seem to be revealing the story of your first love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181873,
      "endMs": 185329
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Do you want me to continue?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 185531,
      "endMs": 187007
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Guess so. It's...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188215,
      "endMs": 190195
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "It's coming to me. Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 190363,
      "endMs": 192846
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I see an eastern university in the year 2010.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 193014,
      "endMs": 196839
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "The world has become a very different place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197007,
      "endMs": 200631
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "I can't wait to see that play.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211638,
      "endMs": 213786
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Hey, watch it. Watch it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224893,
      "endMs": 226940
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "That man is instantly the most annoying person I've ever met.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228215,
      "endMs": 231772
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "A soy-based snack will calm me down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232141,
      "endMs": 234423
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Him again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245933,
      "endMs": 247745
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Hello. I need Ecosystem of the Marsh by Thompson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255128,
      "endMs": 258215
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "The last copy was just signed out by...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258383,
      "endMs": 261638
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "...Hugh Parkfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261806,
      "endMs": 263383
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Oh, there he is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263584,
      "endMs": 265061
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "No. It couldn't be.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265195,
      "endMs": 267108
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Thanks for holding my book while I tied my shoe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 270390,
      "endMs": 272806
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "That's the book I need. You'll probably take forever with it too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273477,
      "endMs": 276564
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I read faster. I read at a 78th-grade level.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276766,
      "endMs": 279115
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Right here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 279316,
      "endMs": 280994
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Finished this page? Ages ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284752,
      "endMs": 287604
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I'll get the dictionary. Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288175,
      "endMs": 289618
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "You'll see. \"Stochastic.\" Pertaining to a process...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289786,
      "endMs": 292604
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "...involving a randomly determined sequence of observations.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 292772,
      "endMs": 296296
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "First, they hate each other. All of a sudden, they love each other.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 300524,
      "endMs": 303645
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Oh, it doesn't make any sense to me. Of course not. You're a robot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 303846,
      "endMs": 307470
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I never met anyone who so understood the magic of Jim Carrey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 317437,
      "endMs": 320289
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "He can make you laugh with no more than a frantic flailing of his limbs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 320457,
      "endMs": 323947
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "I can't believe how much we have in common.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325255,
      "endMs": 327101
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "We're studying the environment, we're utterly humorless about vegetarianism.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327302,
      "endMs": 330859
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "And we both love the Rolling Stones.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 330994,
      "endMs": 332403
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Yes. Not for their music but for their tireless efforts...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334517,
      "endMs": 336262
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "...to preserve historic buildings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 336430,
      "endMs": 338175
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Lisa, I can't bear being apart all summer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 338309,
      "endMs": 340390
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Come with me to Parkfield Manor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340557,
      "endMs": 342068
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I'd love to. Can we get vegetarian meals at your parents' house?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342235,
      "endMs": 345625
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Yes, we can, Lisa. That is good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345826,
      "endMs": 347537
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Because eating animals is wrong. So very wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347705,
      "endMs": 350423
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "When will the world learn? I don't know. I just don't know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350591,
      "endMs": 354685
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "I love these new planes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356631,
      "endMs": 358376
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Yes. It's a good thing they re-evaluated those wacky old designs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358544,
      "endMs": 361766
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Beautiful dinnerware, Mrs. Parkfield. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373779,
      "endMs": 376229
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "They were made for the finest family in Britain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376396,
      "endMs": 378712
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I don't know how we ended up with them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378913,
      "endMs": 381430
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Should I laugh? Was that dry British wit or subtle self-pity?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382437,
      "endMs": 385490
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "They're staring at me. Better respond.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 385658,
      "endMs": 387403
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "It's good to hear a boisterous American laugh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390054,
      "endMs": 393477
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "And I love that painting. Judging by the clothes, I'd say 17th century.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393678,
      "endMs": 397370
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Actually, Lisa, it's just Uncle Eldred.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397571,
      "endMs": 399953
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I get me brain medicines from the National Health.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400155,
      "endMs": 404249
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "This place is so enchanting, Hugh. I love it here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405792,
      "endMs": 409517
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "I wanted this to be perfect for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409752,
      "endMs": 411766
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I know you Americans like everything to be...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411933,
      "endMs": 414450
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "...fireworks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414618,
      "endMs": 416296
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Oh, blast. Go to plan B.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426833,
      "endMs": 429551
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Yes, I will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433242,
      "endMs": 435222
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Isn't it wonderful?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438242,
      "endMs": 439853
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Master Hugh has found a true love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440054,
      "endMs": 444886
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Hi, Mom. Lisa. Hello.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454021,
      "endMs": 456772
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "How are you doing in England? Remember, an elevator is a \"lift\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456940,
      "endMs": 460061
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "...a mile is called a \"kilometer,\" and botulism is \"steak-and-kidney pie.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460229,
      "endMs": 463953
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Guess what. Hugh and I are getting married.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464155,
      "endMs": 466101
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "All right! Lisa, that's wonderful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466302,
      "endMs": 470430
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "If only your father was still with us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470598,
      "endMs": 474121
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "But he left for work a few minutes ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 474289,
      "endMs": 476537
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Remember we'd always plan my dream wedding, and you always promised...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476739,
      "endMs": 480967
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "...to, you know, well, keep Dad from ruining it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481135,
      "endMs": 485161
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Oh, don 't worry, honey. I guarantee your father will behave.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485363,
      "endMs": 489088
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Mom, it's a Picturephone. Oh, this? This?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489289,
      "endMs": 491739
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, no. I just got a touch of the rheumatiz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491906,
      "endMs": 494188
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Mom, Picturephone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 495833,
      "endMs": 496906
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Hi, Mom. Oh, that's great news about Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 499021,
      "endMs": 501336
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Well, listen, I better get back to work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501504,
      "endMs": 503383
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "They're finally paying me for this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505229,
      "endMs": 507779
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 511168,
      "endMs": 512812
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Yes, but the international market is my focus.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521202,
      "endMs": 523953
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Oh, Marge, that's great news.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525161,
      "endMs": 527410
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Hey, hey, there with the personal calls, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527645,
      "endMs": 529994
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "But, Mr. Milhouse, my little girl's getting married.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530631,
      "endMs": 533752
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Lisa?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533953,
      "endMs": 535262
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "My one true love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 536269,
      "endMs": 538081
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "It's not you, Milhouse. I just don't plan to ever get married.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 539457,
      "endMs": 542779
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "I think I'll write your performance evaluation now, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547578,
      "endMs": 552141
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "I gotta call everyone and tell them the good news.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557276,
      "endMs": 559658
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "What the...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560161,
      "endMs": 561202
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Maggie, I need to use the phone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561336,
      "endMs": 563685
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Will that girl ever shut up?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566230,
      "endMs": 568042
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "I'll plan everything. We can have the reception at Moe's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568277,
      "endMs": 571297
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Why not have the whole wedding there. We'll do it on a Monday morning.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571465,
      "endMs": 574686
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "There'll be fewer drunks. Don't take this personally.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574854,
      "endMs": 577639
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "I've obtained a court order to prevent you from planning this wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577807,
      "endMs": 581029
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "\"Whereas Homer Simpson...\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581196,
      "endMs": 582505
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Well, these seem to be in order. I'll be in the hammock.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582673,
      "endMs": 585391
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "\"Mr. Smithers plus guest.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588210,
      "endMs": 590492
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "There's only one person I'd wanna bring.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591297,
      "endMs": 593176
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Oh, Mr. Burns, we'll thaw you out the second they discover the cure...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596532,
      "endMs": 600525
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "...for 17 stab wounds in the back. How we doing, boys?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 600693,
      "endMs": 603344
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Well, we're up to 15.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 603545,
      "endMs": 605324
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "We're invited to the wedding of our only graduate to read at an adult level.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 615106,
      "endMs": 618831
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "It must be Lisa Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618999,
      "endMs": 620408
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Of course, Martin Prince perished in that science-fair explosion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620609,
      "endMs": 624066
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Not quite perished, my lady love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 624905,
      "endMs": 627623
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Although some days I wish I had.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627757,
      "endMs": 630475
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Hey, I remember you. Mayor Quimby, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644099,
      "endMs": 646616
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "No. Look at this license. I'm Mohamed Jafar.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 647757,
      "endMs": 650542
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Quimby, after this fare, get your indicted ass to the convention center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650744,
      "endMs": 654200
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "I cut the ribbon at that convention center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654435,
      "endMs": 656582
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Just a couple more blocks to my house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660207,
      "endMs": 663596
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Darling, don't worry. I'm sure I'll get along with your family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 666878,
      "endMs": 669864
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "You prepared me for the worst.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670032,
      "endMs": 671475
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "As long as they're not squatting in a ditch...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 671643,
      "endMs": 673723
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "...poking berries up their noses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673891,
      "endMs": 675871
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "And if they are?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676039,
      "endMs": 677918
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Here they come. Raise the flag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 678992,
      "endMs": 680972
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Oh, Lisa. Yo, Hugh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684596,
      "endMs": 686978
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Here's a little bit of U.S. Hospitality.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687180,
      "endMs": 689529
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "What do you think of that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689697,
      "endMs": 691509
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693757,
      "endMs": 695267
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Now throw compost on it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697381,
      "endMs": 698690
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Enjoy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 702918,
      "endMs": 704596
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Still warm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705468,
      "endMs": 707348
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "You can be the first to try out the new guest bedroom I built.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712529,
      "endMs": 715616
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "If the building inspector comes by, it's not a room, it's a window box.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715750,
      "endMs": 719844
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Oh, Hugh, thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 721421,
      "endMs": 722730
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "You've been just wonderful through this entire ordeal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722898,
      "endMs": 725482
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Lisa, I love you so much. I'm willing to go through anything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725683,
      "endMs": 728905
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Are you okay? I'm fine, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730985,
      "endMs": 734341
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Fortunately, the compost heap broke my fall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734542,
      "endMs": 736858
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Be a dear, run a bath.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737025,
      "endMs": 738670
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Homer, Bart, Maggie, company eating rules.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742428,
      "endMs": 745113
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Oh, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745884,
      "endMs": 747193
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Anyway, Hugh, there's more to my life than just the wrecking ball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 749207,
      "endMs": 753032
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "I also crush cars into cubes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753200,
      "endMs": 755247
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "On the side, I promote local tough-man contests.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755415,
      "endMs": 757730
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "I'm getting out all my aggression till I go to law school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757898,
      "endMs": 760784
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "So, Hugh, have you heard all the latest American jokes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760985,
      "endMs": 763770
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Here's a good one. Pull my finger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763905,
      "endMs": 766220
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Yes, we have that one in England too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 766757,
      "endMs": 768871
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "I said, pull my finger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769072,
      "endMs": 770683
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Mom, we've got my wedding-dress fitting this afternoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770918,
      "endMs": 773468
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Maggie, if you're not doing anything, why don't you come.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773636,
      "endMs": 776388
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Maggie, don't talk with your mouth full.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 776589,
      "endMs": 778569
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Me and Bart will take Hugh out this afternoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 779139,
      "endMs": 781220
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Hugh should take it easy because of his fall.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781421,
      "endMs": 783569
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "The only thing bruised in that fall was my spine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 783737,
      "endMs": 786388
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "I'll be delighted. Great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 786556,
      "endMs": 788334
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "There's only one thing I ask in return. Certainly.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788502,
      "endMs": 790918
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Pull my finger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 791086,
      "endMs": 792126
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "So this driving on the left makes you feel more at home, huh, Hugh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792730,
      "endMs": 795952
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "And tonight, the following celebrities have been arrested: Heather Locklear Fortensky remains at large.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799811,
      "endMs": 805113
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Remember, if you see any celebrities, consider them dangerous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 806589,
      "endMs": 809441
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "You know, I rather like this pub.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809643,
      "endMs": 811522
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "An English boy, eh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 811723,
      "endMs": 813670
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "You know, we saved your ass in World War II.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813837,
      "endMs": 816052
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Well, we saved your ass in World War III.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816254,
      "endMs": 818200
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "That's true. There's something I want you to have.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818401,
      "endMs": 821790
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "My dad gave me his cuff links to wear on the day I married Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821958,
      "endMs": 824945
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "They brought us good luck. I couldn't imagine a happier marriage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 825113,
      "endMs": 828770
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "We don't have many traditions in our family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 828972,
      "endMs": 831455
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "But it would mean a lot to me if you kept this one alive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831623,
      "endMs": 836119
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Well, I'd be honored...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836354,
      "endMs": 838066
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "...to wear those things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 838535,
      "endMs": 842160
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "You know, Fox turned into a hardcore-sex channel so gradually...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844911,
      "endMs": 848670
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "...I didn't even notice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848837,
      "endMs": 850582
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "It's so great to have the whole family together under one roof.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851421,
      "endMs": 854945
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I never realized how much I missed it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855146,
      "endMs": 857059
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Listen to the murmurs in the next room. The house is full of life again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857227,
      "endMs": 862797
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Keep it down in there!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 863703,
      "endMs": 865213
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "All right, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865415,
      "endMs": 867227
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "I'm sorry I left you alone with Homer and Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867395,
      "endMs": 869978
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "No, no, honey. We had a fine time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 870113,
      "endMs": 872529
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "How'd you get that gash? When we hid in the Dumpster...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 872730,
      "endMs": 875482
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "...after the fire alarm went off in the pornographic-magazine warehouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875650,
      "endMs": 879307
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "You are so good to put up with all of this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879509,
      "endMs": 881556
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Oh, don't be silly, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 881723,
      "endMs": 883905
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Everything's fine. Really.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884072,
      "endMs": 886321
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Now, go to sleep. We have a big day ahead of us tomorrow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886488,
      "endMs": 889878
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "A big, long day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890046,
      "endMs": 892999
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Lisa, I can't believe it's your wedding day already.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899978,
      "endMs": 902764
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Mom, I feel kind of funny wearing white. I mean, Milhouse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902965,
      "endMs": 906925
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Oh, Milhouse doesn't count.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907126,
      "endMs": 908468
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Okay, I've got something old, that's my pearl necklace.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912629,
      "endMs": 915750
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Something new is the wedding dress.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915918,
      "endMs": 917562
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Something borrowed is this antique brooch from Hugh's mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917730,
      "endMs": 920817
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Now I just need something blue.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921019,
      "endMs": 922663
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Here. Oh, Mom, thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923703,
      "endMs": 927428
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Wow, Lisa. Looking at you makes me wanna get married for a third time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936757,
      "endMs": 941690
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "I met a really nice exotic dancer at Hugh's bachelor party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941858,
      "endMs": 944744
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Hugh didn't have a bachelor party. We had one in his honor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944945,
      "endMs": 948133
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "I had one in his honor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948905,
      "endMs": 950750
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "I went to a strip club.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 952361,
      "endMs": 953603
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Well, here goes nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953804,
      "endMs": 956858
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Mum, Dad...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958938,
      "endMs": 961522
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "...meet Homer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961723,
      "endMs": 963267
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "How do you do? Hey. How are you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 963435,
      "endMs": 965012
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Nice to meet you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965180,
      "endMs": 966824
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "You know what's great about you English?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 969341,
      "endMs": 971254
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Octopussy. Man, I must have seen that movie...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971421,
      "endMs": 974844
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "...twice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975012,
      "endMs": 976086
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Yes. Yes. That's not too bad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976757,
      "endMs": 980650
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Smithers, take me home. I'm not fully defrosted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982876,
      "endMs": 985796
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "Nonsense. Just sit down and rest for a moment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985964,
      "endMs": 988313
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "There you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988514,
      "endMs": 990259
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Oh, no. We've got a little situation here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990897,
      "endMs": 993615
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "I can't feel anything below my cummerbund.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 993816,
      "endMs": 996199
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Hi, Dad. You look great, sweetheart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 998111,
      "endMs": 1000662
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Thanks. Little Lisa. Lisa Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000829,
      "endMs": 1004084
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "I always felt you were the best thing my name ever got attached to.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004252,
      "endMs": 1007642
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Since you learned to pin your own diapers, you've been smarter than me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007809,
      "endMs": 1011735
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Oh, Dad. No, no. Let me finish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011937,
      "endMs": 1014454
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "I want you to know I've always been proud of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014655,
      "endMs": 1017071
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "You're my greatest accomplishment, and you did it all yourself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017239,
      "endMs": 1020326
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "You helped me understand my own wife better...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1020494,
      "endMs": 1022742
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "...and taught me to be a better person. But you're also my daughter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1022910,
      "endMs": 1026467
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "I don't think anybody could've had a better daughter...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1026635,
      "endMs": 1029386
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Dad, you're babbling. See? You're still helping me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1029588,
      "endMs": 1032675
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Hey, Dad, did you forget to give those cuff links to Hugh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034890,
      "endMs": 1037574
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "No. Well?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038917,
      "endMs": 1040158
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "I found them on the nightstand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040326,
      "endMs": 1041836
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I guess they weren't his cup of tea. Don't worry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042004,
      "endMs": 1044252
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "But you've been going on about these all week.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044420,
      "endMs": 1046568
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "I'm sure he just forgot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046735,
      "endMs": 1048548
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Lisa, we're not supposed to see each other before the wedding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049621,
      "endMs": 1052709
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "It's tradition. What about my family's tradition?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052876,
      "endMs": 1055863
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Surely you don't want me to wear those in front of my parents and their friends.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1056031,
      "endMs": 1059890
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "But you promised my dad you would. I was just humoring him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060058,
      "endMs": 1063346
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Actually, he frightens me a bit. I know they look silly...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063514,
      "endMs": 1066366
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "...but his feelings will be hurt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1066534,
      "endMs": 1068615
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068816,
      "endMs": 1070460
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I must say, you were right. This has been quite trying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070628,
      "endMs": 1073816
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "I've attempted to enjoy your family on a personal level...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1074017,
      "endMs": 1076870
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "...on an ironic level, as a novelty, as camp, as kitsch...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077037,
      "endMs": 1080964
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "...as cautionary example. Nothing works.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1081131,
      "endMs": 1083917
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "When we get back to England, we won't have to deal with them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1084084,
      "endMs": 1087272
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "You saying we won't see my family again?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1087474,
      "endMs": 1089420
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Your mother will come when the children are born.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089621,
      "endMs": 1092071
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "I can't believe I'm hearing this. I don't wanna cut my family out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1092239,
      "endMs": 1095460
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Really? Lisa, you're better than this place.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095628,
      "endMs": 1098514
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "You're like a flower that grew out of dirt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098648,
      "endMs": 1100829
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "That's a horrible thing to say. Oh, come on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101266,
      "endMs": 1103581
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "You complain more than anyone. Maybe, but I still love them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103749,
      "endMs": 1108044
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "And I don't think you understand that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108246,
      "endMs": 1111735
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "And now, to sing \"Amazing Grace\"...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1116199,
      "endMs": 1118682
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "...Miss Maggie Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1118883,
      "endMs": 1120997
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "She's quite a hellion, but does have an incredible voice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121803,
      "endMs": 1124454
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Stop everything. The wedding has been called off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126836,
      "endMs": 1129454
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "This is very sad news.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135695,
      "endMs": 1138246
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "It never would've happened if the wedding was in the church with God...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138447,
      "endMs": 1142843
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "...instead of out here in the cheap showiness of nature.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1143011,
      "endMs": 1146635
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Who wants cake?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1146836,
      "endMs": 1148749
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "The next day, Hugh goes back to England, and you never see him again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164789,
      "endMs": 1169051
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Now that I know, isn't there any way to change the future?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1170561,
      "endMs": 1173413
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "No. But try to look surprised.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173615,
      "endMs": 1175997
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "You said you'd tell me about my true love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176199,
      "endMs": 1178178
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Oh, you'll have a true love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178346,
      "endMs": 1180460
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "But I specialize in foretelling the relationships...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1180662,
      "endMs": 1183111
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "...where you get jerked around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183279,
      "endMs": 1185125
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "Lisa, where were you? You missed the most incredible thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1199211,
      "endMs": 1202197
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "Hi, Dad. I ate seven pounds of fudge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202399,
      "endMs": 1206157
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "text": "The man at the stand said it was a record.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1206929,
      "endMs": 1209244
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "text": "What else did you do, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209412,
      "endMs": 1210721
    },
    {
      "index": 296,
      "text": "I rode the tea cups. Then I got a little sick, and I had to sit down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1210888,
      "endMs": 1214311
    },
    {
      "index": 297,
      "text": "But then I rode them again. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214479,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 6,
    "episode": 19
  }
}
